  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "Consider the differential equation, <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>. If value of <math><mi>y</mi></math> is&nbsp;<math><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;when&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, then the value of <math><mi>x</mi></math> for which <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi></math>is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "Qy85i",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mi>e</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Qf5FN",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mi>e</mi></msqrt></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "TZpmW",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mi>e</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "XMKR7",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mi>e</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
